{"type":"message","message":{"id":"gen-1775392855-pePqLq7rU6xk22ckwjSn","role":"assistant","created":1775392863,"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to answer this question about compound annual growth rate (CAGR) for Federal Old-Age and Survivors Insurance. Let me:\n\n1. First, identify when the Korean War started - I know the Korean War started in June 1950, so I need to figure out which fiscal year that corresponds to.\n2. Then find the expenditure transfers data from the Treasury Bulletin documents.\n\nLet me first check the Korean War start date. The Korean War started on June 25, 1950. The US fiscal year runs from October 1 to September 30. So:\n- FY 1950 runs from Oct 1, 1949 to Sep 30, 1950\n- The Korean War started in June 1950, which is in FY 1950\n\nWait, but I need to be careful. Let me check the actual fiscal year. The Korean War started June 25, 1950. The US federal fiscal year at that time was:\n- FY 1950 = July 1, 1949 to June 30, 1950 (the old fiscal year system)\n- Actually, in 1976, the fiscal year was changed to start on October 1. Before 1976, fiscal years started on July 1.\n\nSo for the Korean War starting in June 1950:\n- If we're using the old fiscal year system (July 1 to June 30), then the Korean War started near the end of FY 1950.\n- If we're using the current system (October 1 to September 30), then June 1950 would be in FY 1950 (Oct 1, 1949 to Sep 30, 1950).\n\nActually, I need to verify this. The fiscal year was changed in 1976 to start October 1. Before that, fiscal years started July 1. So in 1950, the fiscal year would run July 1 to June 30. That means:\n- FY 1950 = July 1, 1949 to June 30, 1950\n\n\n- FY 1951 = July 1, 1950 to June 30, 1951\n\nI'm carefully tracing the timeline to pinpoint the exact fiscal year. Since the Korean War began in June 1950, it's clear this falls within FY 1950 under the pre-1976 fiscal year system. I'll now locate the precise expenditure transfer data for Federal Old-Age and Survivors Insurance during this period.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_dcdee04172584d979f4c0eff","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /app/resources/"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
